\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Exhaustive no-go atlas for one-sided fresh-column activation.} Left: the audited local state spaces have sizes \(256\) in height \(2\) and \(8{,}192\) in height \(3\), corresponding to the complete factorized counts \(4^{h-1}4^h2^h\). Right: both classes have zero strict-improvement states. Error bars have zero width because these are exact counts over complete finite classes, not estimates from random sampling.\relax }}{20}{figure.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:nogo}{{6}{20}{\textbf {Exhaustive no-go atlas for one-sided fresh-column activation.} Left: the audited local state spaces have sizes \(256\) in height \(2\) and \(8{,}192\) in height \(3\), corresponding to the complete factorized counts \(4^{h-1}4^h2^h\). Right: both classes have zero strict-improvement states. Error bars have zero width because these are exact counts over complete finite classes, not estimates from random sampling.\relax }{figure.caption.8}{}}
